            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Evening tranquility embraces the Suez waterfront as the day concludes with a prayerful silence"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Lugares de interés en Rosetta {Rasheed}"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En Rosetta, también conocida como Rasheed, un paseo por sus calles despliega un tesoro de maravillas arquitectónicas, cada una de las cuales cuenta una historia de una época pasada."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Esta ciudad, rica en arquitectura "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "de la época otomana"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", ofrece una visión profunda de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000008"
              ],
              "text": "las"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " diversas capas históricas "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000b"
              ],
              "text": "de Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ottoman_Empire#:~:text=The%20Ottoman%20Empire%2C%20historically%20and,16th%20and%20early%2018th%20centuries.",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/about-egypt/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/about-egypt/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Casas otomanas: Una mirada al pasado"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Las casas otomanas de Rosetta, construidas al estilo tradicional del Delta con pequeños ladrillos planos pintados en tonos alternos de rojo y negro, son una delicia visual."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Estas estructuras de tres pisos a menudo presentan un piso superior "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000014"
              ],
              "text": "que sobresale ligeramente del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " inferior, lo que recuerda a una tarta nupcial de chocolate adornada y colocada al revés."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "Las casas están adornadas con"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " mashrabiyyas, unas intrincadas pantallas de madera que sirven de ventanas, y que contribuyen a su encanto distintivo. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-alejandria/el-templo-del-serapeum/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-87835",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Casa de Mizouni: Una maravilla interior "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Entre estas joyas arquitectónicas, la Casa de Mizouni, de 1740, destaca "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "por su exquisito interior"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Con cinco pisos, presenta diseños similares en las plantas principales, con salones "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000025"
              ],
              "text": "y salas de"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " recepción orientados al norte y habitaciones más pequeñas que rodean un patio."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Lo más destacado es la terraza de la azotea, rodeada de altos muros "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002a"
              ],
              "text": "que ofrecen un mirador aislado sobre"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " la ciudad. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/crucero-por-el-nilo-en-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-90376",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-133412",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Casa de Amasyali: Una fachada de elegancia"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Casa de Amasyali ostenta el mejor exterior de Rosetta, con colores vibrantes y detalles intrincados."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aunque actualmente está cerrada a los visitantes, su reapertura promete un escaparate de espléndidos techos de madera y decoraciones murales, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000033"
              ],
              "text": "incluido un amplio uso del nácar en"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " las mashrabiyyas. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/la-guia-definitiva-de-las-vacaciones-todo-incluido-en-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000037",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Molino de Abu Shahin: Una reliquia funcional"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000039",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Junto a la Casa de Amasyali se encuentra el Molino de Abu Shahin, un molino bellamente restaurado, totalmente funcional y abierto a los visitantes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aquí, los "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003c"
              ],
              "text": "visitantes pueden"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " interactuar con los mecanismos del molino, lo que les ofrece una experiencia histórica práctica. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/vacaciones-inolvidables-en-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000041",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Barrio de la Casa de Ramadán"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000042",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Casa Ramadán y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000044",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000043"
              ],
              "text": "las seis casas que la rodean son"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000045",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " excelentes ejemplos de exteriores bien restaurados, cada uno con variaciones únicas del estilo otomano común."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000046",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000047",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La Casa Ramadán, aunque aún en restauración, contiene "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000049",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000048"
              ],
              "text": "una sala con"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " un techo que es una maravilla artística oculta. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000043",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000048",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-89438",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000004c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Casa Thabet: La más antigua de su clase"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000057",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000004e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Casa Thabet, que data de 1709, es famosa por ser la casa "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000050",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000004f"
              ],
              "text": "de un"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000051",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " mercader otomano más antigua de Rosetta."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000052",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000053",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Sus característicos ángulos inclinados "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000055",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000054"
              ],
              "text": "que desembocan en las esquinas del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000056",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " tejado, tradicionalmente cuadradas, la distinguen de sus contemporáneas. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000004f",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-115614",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000054",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-del-oasis-de-siwa/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000059",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000058",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mezquita Al-Mahali: Un conjunto arquitectónico único"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000005a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La mezquita Al-Mahali, con sus 99 columnas únicas que representan los 99 nombres de Dios en el "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000005c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000005b"
              ],
              "text": "Islam"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000005d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", es un lugar intrigante."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000005e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000005f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Las columnas, procedentes de diversos edificios religiosos, simbolizan la continuidad de la fe y la tradición. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000005b",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "tour.islamic-cairo-day-tour",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000061",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mezquita Muallaqa: Grandeza oculta"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000063",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Escondida entre calles estrechas, la mezquita Muallaqa destaca por su rara balaustrada en el primer piso."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000064",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000065",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Su interior, más grandioso de lo que sugiere su modesto exterior, ofrece un sorprendente contraste. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000067",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Creado el 1 de mayo de 2019"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000069",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Actualizado el 26 de enero de 2024"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "ja",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ロゼッタのおすすめスポット"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ロゼッタ（ラシード）では、街を歩くごとに過去の時代の物語を語る建築の宝庫が広がります。オスマン時代の建築が色濃く残るこの町は、エジプトの多層的な歴史を体感できる貴重な場所です。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "オスマン様式の家々 – 過去へのまなざし"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ロゼッタのオスマン様式の家は、ナイルデルタ特有の赤と黒の交互に塗られた平らな小型レンガで造られており、目にも楽しい風景を生み出しています。3階建ての建物は、上層階が少し張り出しており、まるで逆さのチョコレートウェディングケーキのような造形美が特徴です。マシュラビーヤと呼ばれる精緻な木製スクリーンの窓が、独自の魅力を引き立てています。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ミズーニ邸 – 内部の傑作"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1740年に建てられたミズーニ邸は、ロゼッタの建築遺産の中でも際立つ存在。5階建ての建物は、北向きのリビングルームとレセプションルームを中心に、周囲に小部屋が配置され、中庭を囲む構造になっています。屋上のテラスは高い壁に囲まれ、町全体を見渡せる隠れた展望スポットです。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アマシャーリ邸 – 外観の美"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アマシャーリ邸は、ロゼッタで最も美しい外観を持つと言われています。現在は見学できませんが、再公開されれば、母貝を用いたマシュラビーヤや豪華な木製天井、壁の装飾などが公開される予定です。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アブ・シャヒーン製粉所 – 機能する遺産"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アマシャーリ邸の隣に位置するアブ・シャヒーン製粉所は、完全に修復され現在も稼働している歴史的な製粉所です。訪問者は実際に仕組みに触れることができ、五感で歴史を学ぶことができます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ラマダン邸とその一角"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ラマダン邸とその周囲の6軒の家は、丁寧に修復された外観が美しい、典型的なオスマン様式建築の好例です。現在も修復作業中のラマダン邸の中には、隠れた芸術作品のような天井装飾がある部屋も存在します。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000019",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "サーベト邸 – 最古の商人の館"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1709年に建てられたサーベト邸は、ロゼッタに現存する最古のオスマン商人の邸宅です。斜めに切られた角と、伝統的に四角く整えられた屋根の角がユニークな造形を生んでいます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アル＝マハリ・モスク – 特別な建築構成"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "アル＝マハリ・モスクは、イスラムの「神の99の名」にちなんだ99本の柱が立ち並ぶ、ユニークな建築です。これらの柱は様々な宗教施設から集められ、信仰と伝統の継承を象徴しています。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ムアッラカ・モスク – 隠された壮麗さ"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "細い路地の奥にひっそりと佇むムアッラカ・モスクは、珍しい1階のバルコニー（欄干）が特徴。控えめな外観からは想像できないほど、内部は壮麗で見る者を驚かせます。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000027",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "作成日：2019年5月1日"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "更新日：2025年8月5日"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
